capability httpRequestReader http.request read
purpose operation httpRequestReader "Authority to inspect incoming request path, method, headers, and bounded bodies."
capability httpResponseWriter http.response write
purpose operation httpResponseWriter "Authority to write native HTTP response headers and bodies."
capability heapAllocCapability heap allocate
purpose operation heapAllocCapability "Authority to allocate per-request JSON scratch buffers."
capability heapFreeCapability heap free
purpose operation heapFreeCapability "Authority to release per-request JSON scratch buffers."
capability memoryBufferReadWriteCapability memory.buffer readWrite
purpose operation memoryBufferReadWriteCapability "Authority to read parsed text buffers, compare token strings, and wipe password scratch memory."
capability jsonDocumentReadCapability json.document.tree read
purpose operation jsonDocumentReadCapability "Authority to read parsed JSON document cursors."
capability jsonDocumentWriteCapability json.document.tree write
purpose operation jsonDocumentWriteCapability "Authority to create and destroy per-request JSON documents."
capability bcryptHashCompute bcrypt.hash compute
purpose operation bcryptHashCompute "Authority to verify login passwords and hash/verify refresh tokens through the native bcrypt runtime."
capability jwtTokenSigner jwt.hs256 signVerify
purpose operation jwtTokenSigner "Authority to issue and verify HS256 access tokens through the native JWT runtime."
capability sqliteDatabaseReader database read
purpose operation sqliteDatabaseReader "Authority to execute read-only SQLite statements through standard.sqlite."
capability sqliteDatabaseReadWriter database readWrite
purpose operation sqliteDatabaseReadWriter "Authority to execute SQLite schema, transaction, and command statements through standard.sqlite."
capability processEnvironmentReader process.environment read
purpose operation processEnvironmentReader "Authority to read deployment configuration from process environment variables."

# Executable behavior is split by context module:
# - server_context.sem owns database bootstrap, health/readiness/metrics, and common shell handlers.
# - auth_context.sem owns demo auth state and auth/session handlers.
# - observability_context.sem owns metrics, audit, and request-log state/helpers.
# - auction_context.sem owns auction read/command handlers.
# - event_context.sem owns event type naming and bounded replay.
# - chat_context.sem owns chat command handlers.
# - audit_context.sem owns authenticated bounded audit replay.
